CAPTURE REPORT - TWO-TAILS HOST (YUGITO NII)
Status: COMPLETE. Beast sealed.

Target: Yugito Nii of the Hidden Cloud, jinchuriki of the Two-Tails, Matatabi. A
disciplined kunoichi with substantial control over her beast's flame.

Engagement: the assigned cell confronted the target and forced a full transformation
into the Two-Tails' fire form. The extended engagement wore the beast down until the
host could be bound and restrained. Losses on our side: none of consequence.

Delivery: host transported to the Gedo Statue chamber. Full ten-ring extraction over
three days. Matatabi sealed; second eye open. Host deceased on completion.

Assessment: Cloud will note her disappearance and raise its guard around the remaining
Eight-Tails host. Expect the Raikage to fortify his brother. Defer that target.
